The source code used to build the Design Signoff Model (DSM) is called
ModelGen Source (MGS). The tool used to build the DSM is called ModelGen.

In this release note we keep track the revision history of the 
MGS and DSM.


*** This is c-code based Model source for ARM7TDMI. ***


1.ModelGen Source Revision History
==================================

03Mar2005 ModelGen source 3A-00
-------------------------------

Initial ModelGen source for ARM7TDMI rev3A,  models built with
this version of source will expire on 04 March 2007.




2. DSM revision History
=======================

  date    User       Version                History
